Here, ans is still a list and not a vector. Replace this line with 
sapply(n.dat, l.ratio).

Also the underscore (`_') as assignment has been deprecated in later 
versions of S-PLUS. Use `<-' (S-PLUS 2000) or `=' (S-PLUS 6) instead.

